    {
      "Text": "Security update for rpm",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for rpm fixes the following issue:\n\nSecurity issues fixed:\n\n- CVE-2026-44605: heap buffer overflow in NDB database backend due to unchecked 32-bit arithmetic when parsing the slot\n  table (bsc#1269584).\n\nOther updates and bugfixes:\n\n- Fix `libelf` handle not being closed, resulting in build errors when using a NFS buildroot (bsc#1240054).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
